; mandelbrot.uft — v13: mandelbrot escape count (bench/SPEC.md)
1000 n!
has_args 'argn if
5 float array z!
0 cnt!
n@ 'row for
cnt@ "%d" format print
ret
argn:
  1 arg_index n!
  ret
row: k!
  z@ 3 2.0 k@ mul n@ div 1.0 sub array_set
  n@ 'col for
  ret
col: k!
  z@ 2 2.0 k@ mul n@ div 1.5 sub array_set
  z@ 0 0.0 array_set
  z@ 1 0.0 array_set
  0 it!
  'cond 'body while
  z@ 0 array_get z@ 0 array_get mul z@ 1 array_get z@ 1 array_get mul add 4.0 gt not cnt@ add cnt!
  ret
cond:
  it@ 50 lt z@ 0 array_get z@ 0 array_get mul z@ 1 array_get z@ 1 array_get mul add 4.0 gt not and
  ret
body:
  z@ 4 z@ 0 array_get z@ 0 array_get mul z@ 1 array_get z@ 1 array_get mul sub z@ 2 array_get add array_set
  z@ 1 z@ 0 array_get z@ 1 array_get 2.0 mul mul z@ 3 array_get add array_set
  z@ 0 z@ 4 array_get array_set
  it@ inc it!
  0
  ret
